}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Reality Rift icon0}}
| desc = Teleports Chaos Knight, any illusions he has, and the target unit to a point along the line between him and the target. The enemy unit has their armor reduced for 6s.
}}
* Has the following additional ability interaction with {{M|debuff immune}} sources:
** [[File:Dota2 Chaos Knight Reality Rift Enemy-1 icon.png|105px|The affected enemy's teleportation visualized.]][[File:Dota2 Chaos Knight Reality Rift Enemy-2 icon.png|105px|The affected enemy's teleportation visualized.]]
*** The {{M|teleport}} component pierces debuff immune sources regardless.
*** Without the {{M|talent|t=t3l}}, casting the ability on a debuff immune unit causes the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy to teleport a short distance within line [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]].

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Plays a visual effect at the location of any nearby allied Chaos Knight's {{M|illusions}} upon the ability's {{M|cast point}}, even when the illusions are not Chaos Knight's.
** {{Symbol|Vision|Base}}
*** The ability visual effects can only be seen while having [[vision]] over either Chaos Knight or the affected enemy unit.

{{Illusionnotes
| name = Chaos Strike
| desc = Displays {{M|critical strike}} values before all [[damage manipulation]] sources for camouflaging purposes.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Critical Strike}}
** The [[critical strike]] proc is determined during Chaos Knight's {{M|attack point}} and uses {{M|pseudo-random distribution}} {{Proc|33%|tal=43%}}.
** The proc chance of multiple sources stack.
*** However, when multiple critical strike sources proc simutaneously, the higher critical factor takes precedence.
** {{Symbol|bonus ls}}
*** Grants the critical strike procs [[lifesteal]] as well.
*** Stacks additively with other lifesteal sources.
*** Does not lifesteal when the higher critical factor takes precedence.
** Does not proc on the following units:
** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, and the following units as heroes:
*** {{M|Roshan}}
*** The {{M|Tormentor}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Chaos Strike icon0}}
| desc = Chaos Knight and his illusions' attacks have a chance to deal a critical strike of varying strength with bonus lifesteal. Lifesteal from creeps is reduced.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Increases {{M|attack damage}} by an average of {{calc|{{#var:Chaos Strike value1}}*(({{#var:Chaos Strike value2}}+v1)/2-1) round4|v1={{#var:Chaos Strike value3}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|{{#var:Chaos Strike value1 tal}}*(({{#var:Chaos Strike value2}}+v1)/2-1) round4|v1={{#var:Chaos Strike value3}}|%}}|25tal}}).
** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** Chaos Knight uses a specific attack animation, and particle effects appear on his weapon on proc.

