| desc = Summons several phantasmal copies of the Chaos Knight from alternate dimensions. The phantasms are illusions that deal 60% damage, but take 350% damage.
}}
* The {{M|illusion}} spawn distance is defined as:
** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Caster[[Collision Size|ColSize]] × (NumberOf[[Illusions]] + 2)}}
** For Chaos Knight, the illusion spawn distance is {{calc|{{G|collision size hero}}*(v1+2)|v1=1/2/3}}/{{ValueColor||{{calc|{{G|collision size hero}}*(v1+2)|v1=4}}|agh}} per level.

